  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "8.1.0 is a breaking change. ExtGeometry and the direct mapping to OSGeo.OGR.Geometry are replaced by the immutable PgGeometry, which holds the geometry as EWKB bytes and creates an OGR object only when explicitly asked. Fixes M values being written as zero, the SRID never being written back to the database, and array mappings never taking effect. See the Migration section in the README.",
